Subject: [PATCH] fix -Wextra -Werror build (gcc-14)

- labels/{aix,loop}.c: (void) unused params in ops stubs
- pt-limit.c (shipped gperf output): complete {""} filler initializers
- dos.c: explicit alt_type_id 0; sector_size size_t casts
- {gpt,pt-tools,mac,rdb,udf,table,atari,strlist}.c, arch/linux.c,
  parted/{ui,parted,strlist}.c: sign-compare / pointer-sign casts
  (PedSector vs uint64_t, snprintf vs size_t, iconv (size_t)-1,
  unsigned char id[] vs const char*)
